SilphCo_Interior6_Text_TeamRocketGrunt29Intro::
	.string "I am one of the four ROCKET\n"
	.string "BROTHERS!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_TeamRocketGrunt29Defeat::
	.string "Flame out!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_TeamRocketGrunt29::
	.string "No matter!\n"
	.string "My brothers will avenge me!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_WorkerM_1::
	.string "Oh dear, oh dear.\n"
	.string "Help me, please!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_WorkerM_2::
	.string "We got engaged.\n"
	.string "Heheh!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_RocketM_1::
	.string "That man next to me…\n"
	.string "He’s such a coward!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_RocketM_2::
	.string "He’s so helpless, he needed\n"
	.string "someone like me to look after him.$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_RocketF_1::
	.string "They must have targeted SILPH for\n"
	.string "our POKéMON products.$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_RocketF_2::
	.string "Come work for SILPH when you\n"
	.string "get older.$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "JESS: And that’s why you should be\n"
	.string "helping us to make devices for\l"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "SILPH’s PRES: Do you really think I’ll\n"
	.string "accept?$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "JESS: Hohoho!\n"
	.string "Of course you will.\l"
	.string "You really have no other choice!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "SILPH’s PRES: …$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_5::
	.string "JESS: What are you doing here,\n"
	.string "brat?\p"
	.string "Ruining everything, as always?$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_6::
	.string "JAMIE: Yes, that’s right!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_7::
	.string "JESS: Haven’t we talked about this,\n"
	.string "JAMIE?\p"
	.string "If you want to say something, at\n"
	.string "least say something different, if\l"
	.string "not, then DON’T SAY A WORD!!!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_8::
	.string "All we wanted is this old geezer to\n"
	.string "make us some devices for the massive\l"
	.string "capture of POKéMON...\p"
	.string "That way we could make TEAM ROCKET\n"
	.string "stand out again, for our desired\l"
	.string "comeback.\p"
	.string "But then you have to show up,\n"
	.string "and that means...$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "JESS: You are annoying,\n"
	.string "you know that?$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "JESS: Yes...! Go back home\n"
	.string "crying like the baby you are!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_9::
	.string "JESS: Argh!\n"
	.string "Not again...$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_10::
	.string "JESS: This time it’s all your fault,\n"
	.string "JAMIE!\p"
	.string "If you had a brain, then we could\n"
	.string "have won!$"

SilphCo_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_11::
	.string "JESS: For now... Let’s retreat!$"
